*The [[Southern Continent]] was divided into [[East Balam]] and [[West Balam]].
**'''East Balam''': [[Loen Kingdom|Loen]] and [[Feysac Empire|Feysac]] have been fighting over this colony for a long time. Eventually it became the [[Loen Kingdom]]'s colony.
**'''West Balam''': It is a complicated country that belonged to many factions.<ref>{{Cite Book|1|871}}</ref>
***Some cities are managed by the [[Loen Kingdom]], valleys belongs to [[Intis Republic]].
***Some powerful independent states are secretly connected to the [[Numinous Episcopate]].
***The [[Rose School of Thought]] and [[Feysac Empire]] also have a deep influence on [[West Balam]].
*The crown of the [[Balam Empire]] was obtained by [[Augustus Family]].<ref name="C1087">{{Cite Book|1|1087}}</ref> The king of the Loen Kingdom then gave himself the title "'''Emperor of the Balam Empire'''".<ref name="C1087" />
